# 🚀 LeetCode Tracker Dashboard

An AI-powered LeetCode analytics and interview preparation platform built using Streamlit, Groq LLM APIs, and LeetCode GraphQL APIs.

---

# 🌐 Live Demo

🔗 https://your-app-link.streamlit.app

---

# 📸 Preview

Add screenshots/GIFs here after deployment.

---

# 🌟 Features

## 📊 LeetCode Analytics
- Total solved problems
- Easy / Medium / Hard breakdown
- Global ranking
- Reputation tracking

---

## 📈 Interactive Visualizations
- Pie charts
- Bar charts
- Coding activity heatmap
- Submission tracking

---

## 🤖 AI Roadmap Generator
Generate personalized:
- DSA preparation roadmap
- Weakness analysis
- Topic recommendations
- Interview strategy

Powered by:
- Groq API
- Llama 3 models

---

## 📚 Smart Question Recommendations
Get recommended LeetCode problems based on:
- current progress
- difficulty balance
- interview readiness

---

## 🎯 Interview Readiness Score
AI-inspired readiness evaluation based on:
- solved count
- difficulty distribution
- consistency

---

## 📄 PDF Export
Download generated AI roadmap as:
- professional PDF report

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

## Frontend
- Streamlit

## Backend / APIs
- LeetCode GraphQL API
- Groq API

## AI
- Llama 3 via Groq

## Visualization
- Plotly
- Streamlit Calendar

---

# 📂 Project Structure

```bash
leetcode-dashboard/
│
├── app.py
├── utils.py
├── charts.py
├── ai_engine.py
├── recommender.py
├── heatmap.py
├── grok_ai.py
├── pdf_generator.py
├── style.css
├── requirements.txt
🚀 Installation
1️⃣ Clone Repository
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/leetcode-dashboard.git
2️⃣ Open Project
cd leetcode-dashboard
3️⃣ Create Virtual Environment
python -m venv .venv

Activate:

Windows
.venv\Scripts\activate
Mac/Linux
source .venv/bin/activate
4️⃣ Install Dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
🔑 Setup Groq API

Get API key from:

https://console.groq.com/keys

Add API Key

Inside:

grok_ai.py

Replace:

api_key="YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY"

with your actual API key.

▶️ Run Project
streamlit run app.py
